# Abigale, Eloquent First-Year's trigger resolves on Bot1's Cecil, Dark Knight: no deathtouch, a flying, a first strike and a
# lifelink counter. Then Ephemerate exiles Cecil and returns it: a new object (CR 400.7) that the indefinite "loses all
# abilities" no longer affects and that has no counters (CR 122.2), so it has deathtouch again and none of the three.
# Turn 1: Plains, Mox Jet pays Cecil. Turn 3: Plains, Mox Pearl and a Plains pay Abigale, the other Plains Ephemerate.

